2026-11-01T08:18:49.6085606Z   ok   the inferred estimator reads a real defrost as a PERFECT interval
2026-11-01T08:18:49.6085761Z   ok   an over-1 ratio can no longer park the derate above 1.0
2026-11-01T08:18:49.6085905Z   ok   five defrosting minutes in thirty is a duty of 1/6
