2026-11-01T08:18:49.7681617Z === Manual plan override ===
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7681625Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7681739Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7681869Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682030Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682141Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682228Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682310Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682418Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682526Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682621Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682729Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682839Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682845Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7682940Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683039Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683157Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683257Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683383Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683486Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683608Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683721Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683842Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7683997Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684149Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684156Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684255Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684390Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684511Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684618Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684723Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684736Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684850Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7684995Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685115Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685216Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685330Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685458Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685724Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685853Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685974Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7685980Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7686138Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7686324Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7686481Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7686685Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7686788Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7687001Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7687205Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7687464Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7687693Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7687877Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688031Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688037Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688224Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688414Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688554Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688679Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688811Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688817Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7688972Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7689104Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7689202Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7689311Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7689483Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7689612Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7689720Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7689841Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7690019Z   ok   a non-finite or over-nameplate power reading is no measurement
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7690157Z   ok   a power reading at the nameplate is a measurement
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7690316Z   ok   a frequency past its configured maximum measures nothing
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7690489Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7690608Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7690722Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7690889Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7691089Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7691239Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7691400Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7691584Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7691729Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7691904Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7692083Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7692253Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7692401Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7692603Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7692791Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7692996Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7693126Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7693304Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7693504Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7693670Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7693927Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7694135Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7694326Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7694573Z   ok   the monthly peak sensor publishes the tariff fields it was given
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7694771Z   ok   the default silent fraction is the unset value the fold compares against
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7694778Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7694933Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7695110Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7695233Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7695389Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7695617Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7695760Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7695924Z   ok   forcing hot water off when the tank is hot releases nothing
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7695930Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7696089Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7696205Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7696359Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7696505Z   ok   and the override can still be applied to the horizon
