2026-11-01T08:18:49.7696665Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7696846Z -- Abandoning an unsafe plan does not discard the safe channel
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7696958Z   ok   the breaching channel is abandoned
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697096Z   ok   the channel that was never unsafe keeps its pins
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697229Z   ok   so the space plan the user asked for still holds
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697235Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697419Z -- A released pin is never reported without being planned around
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697554Z   ok   a plan that never converges still terminates
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697679Z   ok   giving up releases every forced-off slot
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697814Z   ok   the abandoned plan is as warm as planning freely
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697939Z   ok   and it heats about as much as planning freely
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7697945Z 
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7698074Z -- No override leaves behaviour unchanged
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7698227Z   ok   winter_dhw: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-11-01T08:18:49.7698362Z   ok   winter_dhw: no pins means the override is inactive
